@host = http://localhost:5122

### List applications (filters are optional)
GET {{host}}/api/applications?status=Applied&track=Developer

### Create an application
POST {{host}}/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Contoso Labs",
  "roleTitle": "Senior .NET Developer",
  "track": "Developer",
  "channel": "LinkedIn",
  "employmentType": "Permanent",
  "status": "Applied",
  "remoteRegion": "Remote EU"
}

### List contacts
GET {{host}}/api/contacts
